set-bg: img/map_2.jpg
new-page: true

> *"Chinese republican politics is like a child who just started schooling. He must have a good teacher and be surrounded by good friends. By the same token, the Chinese people, new to the republican politics, must be educated properly. The revolutionary government should be the people's tutor to impart advanced awareness and experience."
- Dr. Sun Yat-sen, Father of the Chinese Nation

This is a mod about the Kuomintang's origins and how it started and became the leading force of the Republic of China. It will explore much of the power struggle between Wang Jingwei, Chiang Kai-shek, Liao Zhongkai and Hu Hanmin, as well as the NRA's preparations to overthrow the Zhili government of Wu Peifu and Sun Chuanfang.
That is all, enjoy!

- @1924_easy: Begin (easy difficulty)
- @1924_main: Begin (normal difficulty)
- @1924_hard: Begin (hard difficulty)
- @1924_historical: Begin (historical mode)

