= 1924

It is a bright time for Chinese democracy. After a period of struggle against Governor Jiongming, the state of Guangdong is finally under control, and the economy is expanding steadily. The NRA has begun to consolidate and expand as our party gains a strong military arm. In foreign policy, we have reached agreements with the Soviet Union and CPC that might make reunification a reality. 

Now, the task of the Guomindang is to prepare for the Northern Expedition. The warlord-led government of Wu Peifu is unpopular, and we stand to gain. Perhaps the next government will raise the flag of the White Sun.


